	COREVIA OVERVIEW

Corevia is a company management system that helps industries to optimize their productivity.
Corevia centralize all operations that companies share between many softwares, wich causes a lack of time and productivity, and can easily become heavy for employees. Moreover, it centralize datas that companies share between many remote servers. Using that solution facilitates the management, and automatize operations that spend much time in the enterprise.

AVAILABLE MODULES
	-Human Ressources
	-Accounting
	-Finances and payrolls
	-Marketing
	-customized departments
	
